		(property "Description" "High-Speed CAN transceiver with SEPARATE VIO. VCC = 5V, VIO = 3V3. The plain TJA1051T is 5V-logic only and would drive 5V into the Teensy 4.1, which is NOT 5V tolerant - that is why this variant is required. V2 used this part too."
