		(property "Description" "Four-terminal Kelvin shunt for INA228 current sensing, Vishay WSK2512 body, 2W class, 1mOhm-100mOhm. On this footprint the CURRENT path is pads 1 and 4 (4.65mm2 each) and the SENSE taps are pads 2 and 3 (1.06mm2). Wire the pack current through 1-4 and the INA228 Vin+/Vin- to 2-3; sensing off the current pads instead lets trace resistance swamp a sub-milliohm reading."
