					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Description" "JST-XH 4-pin: sense leads for the OFF-BOARD drive shunt. The drive pack never reaches this carrier - only the elec and winch XT60s do, and the VESCs are off-board on CAN - so the ~100A shunt is external and only its Kelvin sense pair comes here. 1=GND (drive return, star point), 2=VDRIVE (rail, feeds both U9 Vbus and the R1/R2 divider), 3=SH+, 4=SH-. Suggested external shunt for 2x100A peak: 0.25mOhm, giving 25mV at 100A and about 2.5W - bolt-down or wide-body, with its own Kelvin taps."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(hide yes)
