			)
		)
		(property "Description" "32.768 kHz crystal for the BNO085 32K oscillator, across U4 pin 27 (XIN32) and pin 26 (XOUT32/CLKSEL1), with 22 pF to GND on each per datasheet Figure 1-7. Two 22 pF in series plus stray gives the ~12.5 pF CL the crystal must be specified for. CEVA require 50 ppm or better. CLKSEL0 must stay tied to GND: CLKSEL0=0 selects the crystal source, and CLKSEL1 is the crystal pin itself. Epson FC-135 / Abracon ABS07 3215 land pattern."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(hide yes)
